-- 639: shared scene pools deduplicated (NIGHTLY_POOL_CLEANUP_PLAN.md phase 3,
-- scripts/clean-scenario-pools.js). Same method as the location spots (mig 633): an LLM grouped same-idea scenes per
-- table / pool / category (big categories split by their card), and only pairs a second pair-by-pair check confirmed are
-- disabled, keeping the best of each group. Holiday rows are untouched (phase 5). 1035 rows disabled
-- (reversible: disabled = false). Re-runnable.
-- Plus: the 14 live couple scenarios with no card or category tag (unreachable since the scope switch, mig 612) are
-- tagged by setting, mirroring how the rest of their category is tagged (sea mounts -> Mermaid Lagoon, snow wolves ->
-- Winter Wonderland / Enchanted Forest, mammoths and raptors -> Prehistoric); the 15th was a confirmed duplicate.

